  "dek": "Kajetan Schweighofer gains 11.25 points in the morning comparison and takes twelfth. Tufa’s 88.06 remains the target, while recorded improvements lift ARC Raiders and Majkel1337.",
  "discord": "The ARC Daily Digest · Early edition · October 12\n\nARC-AGI-2: Kajetan Schweighofer gains 11.25 points in the morning comparison, reaches 47.92 and rises from 27th to 12th, inside the provisional public gold places.\n\nTufa Labs holds first at 88.06, ahead of rabbithole at 80.56. Separate recorded improvements lift ARC Raiders to 62.08 in eighth and Majkel1337 to 52.50 in ninth; their midnight net changes are unknown.\n\nThe issue also follows Aneesh & Yash’s climb and separates the wire’s longer reporting windows from fresh overnight gains. Medals remain unsettled.\n\nhttps://arc.markbarney.net/news/2026-10-12-morning-arc-2",
